        {
          "path": "_m/w/e/c/p/ten-thousand-buddhas-monastery-wp/monastery-of-ten-thousand-budd-1.jpg",
          "filename": "Monastery of Ten Thousand Buddhas 萬佛寺 (5380241824).jpg",
          "caption": "Two more Guanyin statues, out of hundreds more. While every Guanyin statue here is unique, each one follows one of several predetermined themes.\nThe right one is the Eleven-Faced Guanyin. Loving the stacked layout of the extra faces.\nLegends talk of Guanyin splitting her head open to grow the extra faces, when she is overwhelmed with the world's cries for help.\n\nBoth statues are topless, and in fact, every Eleven-Faced Guanyin here is baring her left breast.",
          "alt": "Two more Guanyin statues, out of hundreds more. While every Guanyin statue here is unique, each one follows one of several predetermined themes.\nThe right one is the Eleven-Faced Guanyin. Loving the stacked layout of the extra faces.\nLegends talk of Guanyin splitting her head open to grow the extra faces, when she is overwhelmed with the world's cries for help.\n\nBoth statues are topless, and in fact, every Eleven-Faced Guanyin here is baring her left breast.",
          "width": 750,
          "height": 1000,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
